sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Customer
  participant API as Core API
  participant WF as Workflow engine
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant OB as Outbox
  U->>API: POST /tickets (Idempotency-Key)
  API->>DB: check idempotency key
  API->>WF: evaluate active workflow rules
  WF-->>API: actions (assign least-loaded agent, set priority)
  API->>DB: insert ticket, activity, SLA deadlines, outbox row (one tx)
  API-->>U: 201 Created
  OB->>OB: relay publishes ticket.created and ticket.assigned
  Note over API,DB: Scheduled SLA job later escalates at configured percent thresholds
